3 Workspace
***********

A workspace is any directory containing a ‘.polygram’ marker.

     .polygram        workspace marker
     model.md         operating model (read first to resume context)
     MEMORY.md        one-line-per-note index
     memory/          one fact per file; tags drive synthesis
     skills/          synthesized / curated skills
     advice/          history of gate / dist / operator verdicts
     dist/            minted archives + .skill bundles (gitignored)
     externs/         cloned upstream sources


