7 Command reference
*******************

‘polygram init’
     Create a workspace in the current directory.
‘polygram doctor’
     Report the runtime and validate the externs manifest.
‘polygram scan’
     Parse memory and list skill candidates.
‘polygram gate’
     Evaluate candidates and write advice (no synthesis).
‘polygram synth’
     Gate, then synthesize a skeleton for every PASS.
‘polygram review’
     List HOLD candidates; ‘--promote’, ‘--reject’, ‘--freeze-extern’.
‘polygram extern’
     Manage upstream sources: ‘add’, ‘list’, ‘sync’, ‘freeze’,
     ‘unfreeze’.
‘polygram list’
     List synthesized skills and recent advice.
‘polygram dist’
     Mint distributable archives and ‘.skill’ bundles (*note
     Distribution::).

   Global options: ‘-C DIR’/‘--dir DIR’ operate as if started in DIR;
‘--version’ prints the version.


